{"title":"Must-Watch: Killian Bron Adventure Documentary — Mirage","link":"https://bikerumor.com/must-watch-killian-bron-adventure-documentary-mirage/","date":1789069865000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-video-banner-1536x1024.jpeg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"(All photos / Pierre Vieira)\" /></p>\n<p>Killian Bron has been blowing our minds for years with both his short- and long-form video projects. The French mountain bike rider and racer is extremely talented and fun to watch; his videos are beautifully filmed and edited and typically take viewers to exotic locations that most of us will never ride or even see in person. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding.jpeg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding.jpeg\" alt=\"Killian Bron riding on a ridge in some exotic location for Mirage.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding.jpeg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bron-Mirage-riding-1350x900.jpeg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In the past few years, Bron, Commencal, and his team have been putting out long-form mountain bike adventure documentaries, including Fuego (2023), Dolomites (2024), Mandala (2025), and his latest, Mirage (2026). More than just bike porn, Bron’s documentary films take viewers on a visual journey. You can find them all on his <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/KilianBron\">YouTube channel</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-1536x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"Killian Bron and his guide posing in front of Huayna Potosi\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide-1350x900.jpeg 1350w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-guide.jpeg 2000w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-1536x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"Killian Bron climbing Huayna Potosi with a bike on his back\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing-1350x900.jpeg 1350w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-climbing.jpeg 2000w\" /></a></figure>\n<figcaption>Killian Bron, bike mountaineering in Bolivia for Mirage.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>In Mirage, Bron returns to Huayna Potosí, a 6,088-meter (19,974 feet) peak in the Cordillera Real in Bolivia, three years after his first attempt to climb and ride what is typically a mountaineering objective. Through stunning cinematography and compelling storytelling, Bron and his team retrace the adventure across Argentina and Bolivia, highlighting the preparation, people, camaraderie, and natural beauty experienced along the way. Oh, and there’s some mountain biking too.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding.jpeg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-1536x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"Killian Bron riding from the top of a very high mountain.\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-1536x1024.jpeg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-720x480.jpeg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding-1350x900.jpeg 1350w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mirage-Bron-riding.jpeg 2000w\" /></a><figcaption>Can you spot the mountain biker?</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>An hour and fifteen minutes long, Mirage is a full-length documentary and worth every minute of your time. Do yourself a favor and set aside a little time to watch this amazing film, and see if Bron rides Huayna Potosí this time.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><div>\n\n</div></figure>","author":"Jeremy Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/must-watch-killian-bron-adventure-documentary-mirage/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"3cb9f5cfdea1e76d4a8c56b6ccb50747e7e068300f2fd884f0068a7e02488d85","category":"Cycling"}